<title>USA: Motorola to expand China cellular network.</title>
<headline>Motorola to expand China cellular network.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON HEIGHTS, Ill. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Motorola Inc said on Tuesday that its Asia/Pacific cellular infrastructure group signed a multi-million dollar contract for the most recent expansion of its cellular network in Tianjin, China.</p>
<p>The Global System for Mobile Communications network will expand to nearly 160,000 subscribers from 80,000.</p>
<p>	 -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
